WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:36.140
Rafael, it’s time to end our fight.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:40.330
I acknowledge you as a true duelist.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:45.320
But I can't accept your idea of destiny!

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.870
I'll never use The Seal of Orichalcos again.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:55.760
You cherish the bond you have with your monsters, so why are you using it?

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:01.770
Immortal!
Guardian Dreadscythe

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.530
Rafael, why?

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:10.580
Why would a duelist like you…

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:15.610
I'll give all I have in this fight.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:22.650
And by stealing your soul, I'll prove that Dartz's destiny is the correct one.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.520
Rafael...

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:27.290
He’s the guy who defeated Yugi!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.800
What?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.260
That guy?

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:37.220
Nameless Pharaoh, I'll show you The Seal of Orichalcos's true power...

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.310
...when it’s combined with the darkness in my heart.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.760
The darkness in his heart...

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:59.320
While you're in this Seal, can you really keep the bond with your monsters?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.430
Here I go!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:04.060
Guardian Grarl attacks Kuribabylon!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.910
Decisive Slash!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.670
I flip over my set card!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.690
Rope of Life!

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:21.550
When a battle sends my monster to the graveyard, I can activate it by discarding my hand!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.470
I have no cards in my hand.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.050
I Special Summon Kuribabylon!

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:33.800
I set a card and end my turn.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.310
Yugi...

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.890
Is he okay?  He only has 1000 life points left.

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:41.130
1000 points are plenty!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.520
I believe in him!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:48.280
But The Seal of Orichalcos's power is must stronger than this.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:52.580
Yugi, you tarnished your Duel King title.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.080
But can you clear it now?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.520
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.100
I activate Kuribabylon’s effect!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.820
Separate into the five Kuriboh brothers!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.830
I activate Kuribeh’s effect!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.640
Combine into Kuribandit!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:30.120
From my hand, I activate the spell card, Dark Magic Curtain!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:37.360
By paying half my life points, I can Special Summon Dark Magician!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.740
Yeah!  It's Dark Magician!

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:49.140
But Yugi now only has 500 life points.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.540
H-He's fine!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.670
Dark Magician attacks Guardian Elma!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.600
Black Magic!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:00.620
I flip over my set card!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.450
Guardian Formation!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.930
What?

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:14.230
When a Guardian is attacked, I can activate this card.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.430
I can change the location of a monster.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:22.930
As long as there's a monster in front of it, you can't attack the monster in the back!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:25.940
Run into hiding?  That's not fair!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:31.940
His deck is built to take advantage of the Seal's full potential.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:37.680
I can activate an Equip Spell from my deck!

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.680
Celestial Sword - Eatos!

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:46.100
I end my turn.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.480
Celestial Sword - Eatos...

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.090
Is that monster coming?

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:53.420
My turn.  I draw!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:59.340
Nameless Pharaoh, you're about to relive your nightmare.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.880
Come out, Guardian Eatos!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.360
Guardian Eatos!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:22.360
When there are no monsters in my graveyard, I can summon Eatos without tributing.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:27.860
I sense overwhelming power that can destroy everything instantly!

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:41.950
You're fine seeing Eatos like this?

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.350
Is that what you should be worried about?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.520
This is bad!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:54.090
That monster defeated Yugi!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:58.720
It absorbs the attack points of monsters in the opponent's graveyard!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.670
What?

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.970
Oh no!  At this rate...

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:04.100
Can't he do anything?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:07.100
I activate Kuribandit’s effect!

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:13.780
By tributing Kuribandit, I draw five cards from my deck.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:20.130
I send the monster cards to the graveyard and add the rest to my hand!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:24.440
If you do that, his monster gains more attack points!

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:30.760
But it's worth trying if Yugi can draw a card that'll stop Eatos’s attack.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.260
Can you, Yugi?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.770
I'll bet on this draw!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.900
In the end, you're relying on luck?

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:41.270
You’ll never destroy Eatos that way!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.520
Eatos's effect!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.760
Soul of Celestial Sword!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.000
7000 attack points?

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:09.230
Seems you didn't draw the card you wanted.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.170
Go, Guardian Eatos!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:15.200
Forbidden Gospel!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.020
What?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.020
Too bad, Rafael.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:34.290
The card I wanted wasn't a spell or trap.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.530
It was this!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.600
Electromagnetic Turtle!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:45.540
When this card is sent to the graveyard, I can end that turn's battle anytime I want!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.870
No way!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.540
That card was in the graveyard?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.560
Nice, Yugi!

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:51.540
Yeah!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.520
What's going on?

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:57.050
Is destiny telling me to keep fighting?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.050
I end my turn!

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:05.050
I didn’t want to see Eatos turning evil.

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.110
You're wrong after all!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.560
You should’ve never used The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:17.410
You only think that because you didn't commit to the darkness in your heart!

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.410
I summon Big Shield Gardna!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:28.130
And I switch Dark Magician to defense position!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.080
I set a card and end my turn.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.680
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.690
Switching your monster to defense is pointless!

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:44.500
Yugi has two monsters on his field.  Rafael has four.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.700
This is bad!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.930
If Yugi is attacked directly...

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:52.930
Guardians, it's destiny to end this now!

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:57.510
First, Guardian Eatos attacks Dark Magician!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.240
Spirit Opera!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.480
Yugi!

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:04.710
Yugi!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.910
I flip over my set card!

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.840
Magical Hats!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.320
I missed!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:40.620
Nice!  He only has two other monsters in attack position!

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.990
He can't attack Yugi directly!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:48.840
But if Dark Magician is destroyed, Yugi will have no monsters.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:56.830
Rafael, if you're sure that destiny is locked, pick out my Dark Magician!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:01.340
The odds are one in three.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:05.470
Only Grarl is stronger than Dark Magician’s defense points.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.080
In that case...

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.880
Go, Elma!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.260
Fervent Thunder!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.970
Now the odds are one in two.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.020
Go, Guardian Grarl!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:20.090
Decisive Slash!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.360
Why?

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:30.600
Rafael, it seems destiny isn’t locked yet.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:33.700
Is destiny changing?

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:35.790
It can’t be!

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:39.020
My turn isn’t over yet!

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.630
The Equip Spell, Rod of Silence - Kay'est!

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.350
Rod of Silence, bring your master!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:51.350
Come out, Guardian Kay'est!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.370
I end my turn.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.200
Yugi managed to survive.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.800
No.  It looks like Yugi is at a disadvantage.

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.870
But Yugi is pressuring his opponent.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.250
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.570
I activate my spell card, Graceful Charity!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:26.250
I draw three cards from my deck and discard two!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.260
Unless I draw that card...

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.150
C'mon!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.520
Rafael, I drew it!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.500
No way!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:46.740
I activate Eye of Timaeus from my hand!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.110
I merge Eye of Timaeus and Dark Magician!

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:04.090
The legendary dragon, Timaeus!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.710
Come out, Amulet Dragon!

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:21.640
Amulet Dragon's effect activates!

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:25.470
When it's summoned, all spell cards are banished from the graveyard.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.540
And it gains 300 attack points for each one!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:29.780
What?

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:34.870
I sent eight spell cards to the graveyard!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:40.100
So Amulet Dragon’s attack points rise to 5300!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.270
That’ll work!

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:43.330
Yugi!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:47.330
Amulet Dragon!  Attack Guardian Eatos!

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.200
Magic Distortion!

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.580
Eatos!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.390
Eatos...

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.350
What's that?

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.600
The Seal is pulsating?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.020
Rafael...

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.350
That attack sent Eatos to the graveyard.

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:47.690
But its corpse will rise as a new soul!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.600
Eatos is immortal!

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.110
What?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.390
What is that thing?

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:06.850
Is that a monster's ghost?

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:15.560
This is Eatos's effect!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:19.370
When it’s destroyed in battle...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:24.370
...I can Special Summon Guardian Dreadscythe from my deck in defense position!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.390
Guardian Dreadscythe.

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:33.290
And due to Guardian Dreadscythe's effect...

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.760
…it equips the Equip Spell, Reaper Scythe - Dreadscythe!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:42.380
Reaper Scythe's effect activates!

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:48.400
For every monster in my graveyard, it gains 500 attack points!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:54.160
You're going to keep Eatos in the graveyard?

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:59.650
Dreadscythe lives because Eatos is in the graveyard.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:07.140
As long as Dreadscythe is on the field, I can't summon or Special Summon monsters.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:09.620
Rafael, you…!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.880
You haven’t ended your turn yet.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.110
I end my turn.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:20.090
I switch Guardian Dreadscythe to attack position!

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:27.360
And I must tribute all monsters on my field, except Dreadscythe.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:31.370
No way!  You're sending your own monsters to the graveyard?

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.870
Stop it!  This isn't like you!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:47.600
Since four monsters went to the graveyard, Dreadscythe gains 2000 attack points.

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:56.890
It now has more attack points than Amulet Dragon!

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:00.130
Break through the heart's darkness.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.900
Rafael...

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:06.000
Dreadscythe, strike with all your hatred!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.900
Attack Amulet Dragon!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.170
Forbidden Requiem!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.730
You survived.  Barely.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.650
I end my turn.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:25.650
Yugi, can you do anything?

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.220
Yugi...

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.770
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.260
He's fine!  Yugi hasn’t given up!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.760
What will you try, Yugi?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:39.440
I activate the spell card, Card of Sanctity!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:43.500
We both draw until we have six cards in our hands!

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:51.010
I Special Summon Watapon to my field!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:59.250
And I tribute it to summon Dark Magician Girl in defense position!

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:10.500
I set a card and end my turn.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:16.010
You don't know when to give up, so I'll end you now.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:18.240
My turn.  I draw!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:23.720
I activate the spell card, Obedience from my hand!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:30.420
When the monster with the most attack points attacks a monster...

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.720
...it must take the attack in attack position.

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:36.720
Dreadscythe attacks Dark Magician Girl!

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.370
This is the end.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:45.720
This will determine destiny!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.000
Forbidden Requiem!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.840
I flip over my set card!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.680
Magical Pigeon!

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:00.970
What?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:06.510
This card only activates when Dark Magician Girl is on my field.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:11.990
It turns Dark Magician Girl into a Pigeon Token in defense position for one turn.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:17.320
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:26.980
How can you defy destiny?

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:29.520
Where do you get that power?

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:35.500
I believe something will change when this fight is over.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:45.260
I'll duel with all my strength until I see how you and I change!  That's all there is to it!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.160
Me?  Change?

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.760
My destiny is set!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.250
Partner...

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:59.220
Even if it hurts you, unless you're willing to bear the burden of your opponent's darkness...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:02.470
...you’ll never understand their pain or sorrow.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.120
Haga...  Mai...

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.100
Even Doma's Three Musketeers!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.920
You can't hear their painful screams!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.110
You're right, partner.

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.290
Lend me your strength!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.690
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.900
Partner, this is the card that'll save him!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:26.610
Rafael, I finally heard your screams.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:27.800
Screams?

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:28.960
Yes.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.500
When Eatos went to the graveyard...

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.620
When your guardians were tributed...

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.800
Your heart screamed.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.320
Right?

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:41.950
Nonsense.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:48.370
My partner taught me that unless I’m willing to carry the burden of my opponent's darkness...

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.630
...I can't understand his pain or sorrow.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.960
I'll help carry the burden of your heart's darkness!

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:57.960
What nonsense!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:02.420
And I'll silence your screams with this card!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.350
What are you going to do?

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:09.300
I activate the spell card, Underworld Circle from my hand!

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:11.570
Underworld Circle?

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:17.350
Rafael, I’ll let you meet the monsters you sent to the graveyard!

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.170
What are you doing?

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.620
What’s going on?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:40.670
Yugi!

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:43.680
I can’t see them anymore.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:06.580
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:14.950
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:26.110
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:35.600
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:44.660
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:50.170
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:55.320
For me to be me

00:22:55.320 --> 00:23:03.810
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:09.450
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:19.110
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:31.500
To save Rafael's heart from darkness, Yugi activated Underworld Circle.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:37.830
On the field surrounded by a black aura, Yugi sees Rafael's sad memories.

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:42.420
His despair after losing his family created Guardian Dreadscythe.

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:46.980
Can Yugi defeat Dreadscythe and save Rafael's soul?

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:49.850
